{"info":{"name":"BMA-61 비밀번호 재설정 API (S13)","description":"BMA-61 비밀번호 재설정 API 검증 컬렉션 (S13 사양서 v1.4).\n\n링크 요청(미가입·탈퇴 이메일도 같은 응답) → 토큰 확인 → 위조·규칙 위반 거부 → 재요청 시 이전 링크 무효 → 새 비밀번호 설정 후 옛 세션·옛 비밀번호 거부 → 토큰 재사용 거부 순서로 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해야 한다.\n\n사전 조건\n- docker compose up -d --build\n- 서버 환경변수 PASSWORD_RESET_EXPOSE_DEBUG_LINK=true (메일 대신 응답의 debugResetLink 에서 토큰을 읽는다. 운영 금지)\n\n만료 시나리오(30분)는 DB 에서 EXPIRE_DATE 를 과거로 돌려 확인한다 — backend/scripts/verify-password-reset.sh 의 DB_EXEC_CMD 참고.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. 사용자 A 회원가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정을 쓴다. 서버는 PASSWORD_RESET_EXPOSE_DEBUG_LINK=true 여야 링크를 응답에서 읽을 수 있다.","const t = Date.now();","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailA\", \"reset-a-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailB\", \"reset-b-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"unknownEmail\", \"nobody-\" + t + \"@bma.test\");"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"2. 로그인 A (리프레시 토큰 보관)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", d.accessToken); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshA\", d.refreshToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"3. 미가입 이메일 요청 (S13-04) → 같은 응답, 링크 없음","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"sent=true, 30분, debugResetLink=null\", () => { pm.expect(d.sent).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.expiresInMinutes).to.eql(30); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"debugResetLink\", null); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{unknownEmail}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","request"]}}},{"name":"4. 이메일 형식 오류 → 400 COMMON_001","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 COMMON_001\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"COMMON_001\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"not-an-email\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","request"]}}},{"name":"5. A 요청 (S13-05) → 링크 발급","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const tok = (d.debugResetLink || \"\").split(\"token=\")[1];","pm.test(\"sent=true, 링크에 token\", () => { pm.expect(d.sent).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.debugResetLink).to.include(\"/reset-password?token=\"); pm.expect(tok).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty; });","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token1\", tok);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","request"]}}},{"name":"6. 토큰 확인 (S13-06 진입)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"valid=true, expiresAt\", () => { pm.expect(d.valid).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.expiresAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/validate?token={{token1}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","validate"],"query":[{"key":"token","value":"{{token1}}"}]}}},{"name":"7. 위조 토큰 확인 → 400 AUTH_017","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 AUTH_017\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"AUTH_017\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/validate?token=forged-token","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","validate"],"query":[{"key":"token","value":"forged-token"}]}}},{"name":"8. 위조 토큰 확정 → 400 AUTH_017","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 AUTH_017\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"AUTH_017\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"token\":\"forged-token\",\"newPassword\":\"{{newPassword}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","confirm"]}}},{"name":"9. 규칙 위반 새 비밀번호(숫자만) → 400 COMMON_001","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 COMMON_001\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"COMMON_001\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"token\":\"{{token1}}\",\"newPassword\":\"12345678\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","confirm"]}}},{"name":"10. 규칙 위반 후에도 토큰은 유효","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.test(\"valid=true\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.valid).to.eql(true));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/validate?token={{token1}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","validate"],"query":[{"key":"token","value":"{{token1}}"}]}}},{"name":"11. A 재요청 → 새 토큰","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","const tok = (d.debugResetLink || \"\").split(\"token=\")[1];","pm.test(\"새 토큰\", () => pm.expect(tok).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"token1\")));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token2\", tok);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","request"]}}},{"name":"12. 이전 링크는 무효 → 400 AUTH_017","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 400 AUTH_017\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(400); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"AUTH_017\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/validate?token={{token1}}","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","validate"],"query":[{"key":"token","value":"{{token1}}"}]}}},{"name":"13. 새 비밀번호 설정 (S13-09)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"sessionsEnded=1, changedAt\", () => { pm.expect(d.sessionsEnded).to.eql(1); pm.expect(d.changedAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"token\":\"{{token2}}\",\"newPassword\":\"{{newPassword}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset/confirm","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","password-reset","confirm"]}}},{"name":"14. 옛 리프레시 토큰 재발급 → 401","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refreshA}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","refresh"]}}},{"name":"15. 옛 비밀번호 로그인 → 401","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"16. 새 비밀번호 로그인 → 200 (S1 이동)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);"]}}